, "STRUCT_0012": "\\item", "MATH_0014": "$U = f^{-1}(V)$", "STRUCT_0013": "\\item", "MATH_0015": "$a \\in \\mathcal{A}(V)_{+}$", "STRUCT_0014": "\\end{enumerate}", "MATH_0016": "$\\psi(a) \\in \\Gamma(U, \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes \\deg(a)})$", "MATH_0017": "$U_{\\psi(a)}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-lemma-s-open}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:a53866e49f80f7e313ca72a380bdca6e399dab1bcfbd35405060ec96676a7857", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6da5485f89b74ac6776a45132e0f74c186671494f65e999dcecc2eaaa144b688", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0c387b0979e5b3a6f9c61425c77e437095bcaea40723e927dba307cb649f2705"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01O9:statement", "parent_tag": "01O8", "chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "With assumptions and notation as above. The morphism\n<MATH_0001> induces a canonical morphism of schemes over <MATH_0002>\n<MATH_0003>\ntogether with a map of graded <MATH_0004>-algebras\n<MATH_0005>\ncharacterized by the following properties:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> For every open <MATH_0006> and every <MATH_0007> the diagram\n<MATH_0008>\nis commutative.\n<STRUCT_0003> For any <MATH_0009> and any open subscheme <MATH_0010>\nsuch that <MATH_0011>\nis surjective the restriction of the morphism <MATH_0012>\nagrees with the morphism <MATH_0013>\nwhich exists by the construction of the relative homogeneous spectrum,\nsee Definition <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0004> For any affine open <MATH_0014>, the restriction\n<MATH_0015>\nagrees via <MATH_0016> (see Lemma <REF_0002>) with the triple\n<MATH_0017>\nof Lemma <REF_0003> associated to the map\n<MATH_0018>\ninduced by <MATH_0019>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\psi$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$$\nr_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi} :\nU(\\psi) \\longrightarrow \\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U(\\psi)}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\theta :\nr_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi}^*\\left(\n\\bigoplus\\nolimits_{d \\geq 0}\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})}(d)\n\\right)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\bigoplus\\nolimits_{d \\geq 0} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d}|_{U(\\psi)}\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0006": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0007": "$d \\geq 0$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{A}_d(V) \\ar[d]_{\\psi} \\ar[r]_{\\psi} &\n\\Gamma(f^{-1}(V), \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d}) \\ar[d]^{restrict} \\\\\n\\Gamma(\\pi^{-1}(V),\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})}(d)) \\ar[r]^{\\theta} &\n\\Gamma(f^{-1}(V) \\cap U(\\psi), \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d})\n}\n$$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0009": "$d \\geq 1$", "MATH_0010": "$W \\subset X$", "MATH_0011": "$\\psi|_W : f^*\\mathcal{A}_d|_W \\to \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d}|_W$", "MATH_0012": "$r_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi}$", "MATH_0013": "$W \\to \\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-relative-proj}", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "MATH_0014": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0015": "$$\n(U(\\psi) \\cap f^{-1}(V), r_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi}|_{U(\\psi) \\cap f^{-1}(V)},\n\\theta|_{U(\\psi) \\cap f^{-1}(V)})\n$$", "MATH_0016": "$i_V$", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-glue-relative-proj}", "MATH_0017": "$(U(\\psi'), r_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi'}, \\theta')$", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-invertible-map-into-proj}", "MATH_0018": "$\\psi' : A = \\mathcal{A}(V) \\to \\Gamma_*(f^{-1}(V), \\mathcal{L}|_{f^{-1}(V)})$", "MATH_0019": "$\\psi$", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-invertible-map-into-relative-proj}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed204516906ff28d57fceda95a59794bf1c5aab5b5fa6cc1ce036dbdcc1008ee", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7ddf0fd2aeb950ee05cfaad0bc448338db6bf52aa65c23bb5a3bf8da67c60091", "source_math_hash": "sha256:187e64c283102f6409127552919b7872bea8aa0dc5c203f2752155f7294e57e4"}
